  "ambiguities": [
    "Voter disincentivization (veNFT holders lose rewards) and non-negative claimables (claimables become zero when they should be positive) are claimed effects omitted to keep four impacts.",
    "Balance conservation invariant is stated but not tied to a concrete observed value mismatch.",
    "The 'any user' permissionless framing is supported only for update_period(); reset() is limited to new epochs and voter role."
  ]
